<title>USA: Atchison Casting Corp Q3 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Atchison Casting Corp Q3 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATCHISON, Kan. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in Thousands, Except Share Data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					  March 31,	March 31,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> NET SALES	     $66,313    $52,330   $176,933   $130,000</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT	   11,976	7,852     28,728     18,453</p>
<p>Total operating expenses</p>
<p>			     6,182	4,234     15,733	1,760</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME	5,794	3,618     12,995     16,693</p>
<p> INTEREST EXPENSE	  937	  784	2,400	2,056</p>
<p>MINORITY INTEREST IN NET INCOME</p>
<p>   OF SUBSIDIARIES	  77	   64	  111	  137</p>
<p> INCOME BEFORE TAXES   4,780	2,770     10,484     14,500</p>
<p> INCOME TAXES	    1,918	1,307	4,310	5,860</p>
<p> NET INCOME		2,862	1,463	6,174	8,640</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER COMMON AND</p>
<p>   EQUIVALENT SHARES:   0.51	 0.27	 1.11	 1.57</p>
<p> AVG SHRS	    5,580,743  5,513,355  5,562,822  5,512,547</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
